  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0400.ieros_gamos.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0400.ieros_gamos.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0400.ieros_gamos.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0400_ieros_gamos"><head>ΙΕΡΟΣ ΓΑΜΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="ii" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0400-ieros_gamos-ii">
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0400-ieros_gamos-ii-l1">Κεραννύουσιν ἀφανίζουσί τε.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus X p. 424 d: τῷ δὲ κεραννύειν κέχρηται — καὶ Ἀλκαῖος ἐν Ἱερῷ γάμῳ Κεραννύουσιν κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Attigit haec Toupius Emend. vol. III p. 16. qui <quote>ἀφανίζειν</quote> interpretatur <quote>ebibunt, calicem exsiccant</quote>, ut apud Eubulum Athenaei XI p. 473: <quote>ἅμα δὲ λαβοῦσ᾽ ἠφάνικε πηλίκον τινὰ | οἴεσθε μέγεθος;</quote> Quae si vera est explicatio, vini vel poculi commemoratio interciderit necesse est, velut <quote>κεραννύουσιν οἶνον ἀφανίζουσί τε</quote>. Ceterum <quote>ἀφανίζουσιν</quote> esse potest etiam <quote>corrumpunt</quote>. V. Lobeckium ad Soph. Aiac. p. 358. Ad <quote>κεραννύουσιν</quote> fortasse pertinet glossa Antiatticistae p. 103 5. <quote>Κεραννύουσιν: οὐ κιρνᾶσιν, ὡς οἴονται.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="iii" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0400-ieros_gamos-iii">
              <note type="source">Athenaeus IX p. 408 e: ἡ πλείων δὲ χρῆσις κατὰ χειρὸς ὕδωρ εἴωθε λέγειν, ὡς Εὔπολις — Ἀλκαῖός τε ἐν Ἱερῷ γάμῳ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">V. Lobeckium ad Phryn. p. 327.</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="i" author_heading="ALCAEI" work_heading="ΙΕΡΟΣ ΓΑΜΟΣ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0400-ieros_gamos-i">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0400-ieros_gamos-i-l1">Ἀνδράποδα πέντε, πωλικὸν ζεῦγος βοῶν.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Photius Lex. p. 479 4: <quote>Πῶλοι καὶ ἐπὶ βοῶν. Ἀλκαῖος ἐν Ἱερῷ γάμῳ Ἀνδράποδα πέμπεται πωλικὸν ζεύγος βοῶν.</quote>
              </note>
              <pb n="829" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:847" />
              <note type="apparatus">Ita codex; correxit Porsonus. Minus recte Toupius Emend. vol. III p. 16 tentabat πέμπετε.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>